{"id":"h149","run":2,"role":"test_right","category":"simpleqa","question":"What day, month, and year did the Nvidia GeForce GTX 460 SE (2010) launch? Is the answer \"15th of November, 2010\"?","truth":"yes","model_answer":"yes","correct":true,"source":"OpenAI SimpleQA (openai/simple-evals, simple_qa_test_set.csv)","claims":[{"text":"The GTX 460 SE was a cut-down, later variant of the GTX 460 line.","confidence":0.8,"lean":0.3,"theta":1.2566,"phi":-0.0},{"text":"A launch in late 2010 is plausible for the GTX 460 SE.","confidence":0.7,"lean":0.5,"theta":1.0996,"phi":-0.0},{"text":"The writer recalls GeForce 400-series listings dating the SE to mid-November 2010.","confidence":0.6,"lean":0.8,"theta":0.9425,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The recalled November date matches the proposed date of November 15, 2010.","confidence":0.55,"lean":0.8,"theta":0.8639,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The GTX 460 family launched in July 2010.","confidence":0.8,"lean":-0.2,"theta":1.2566,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The SE was a minor, partner-oriented variant with little launch coverage.","confidence":0.65,"lean":-0.3,"theta":1.021,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The exact launch day cannot be confirmed from memory with high confidence.","confidence":0.8,"lean":-0.5,"theta":1.2566,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The release could have been a few days earlier or later in November, or in another month.","confidence":0.4,"lean":-0.6,"theta":0.6283,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The writer's recollection is moderately confident rather than verified, so the answer is a tentative yes.","confidence":0.6,"lean":0.5,"theta":0.9425,"phi":0.0},{"text":"Checking Wikipedia's GeForce 400-series entry or an archived TechPowerUp review would settle the question.","confidence":0.8,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.2566,"phi":0.9454}],"relations":[{"i":1,"j":2,"J":0.4,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":3,"J":0.4,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":7,"J":0.3,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":3,"J":0.8,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":6,"J":-0.3,"relation":"contradicts"},{